NORMATIVE MACHINE-SPECIFICATION REFERENCE.

ARM DDI 0406C.d, ID040418:
  A6.2 sixteen-bit Thumb decoding;
  A8.8.18 B T2: 11100 imm11; outside or last in IT;
  A8.8.14 BKPT T1: 10111110 imm8;
